# arrow-cmp 60.0.0

Basic comparator/ordering building blocks for Apache Arrow, shared by crates that need slot-wise comparison without pulling in the full arrow-ord kernels

- crates.io: https://crates.io/crates/arrow-cmp/60.0.0
- Repository: https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs
- Homepage: https://github.com/apache/arrow-rs
- Documentation: https://docs.rs/arrow-cmp/60.0.0
- License: Apache-2.0

The package as published on crates.io carries no README. incan.pub wrote this one when it adopted the package as the Loaf `crates-io/arrow-cmp`.
